BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 719 Td (  cd tests/BackendAssessment/Newman) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 704 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 689 Td (1. Install Newman:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 674 Td (  npm install) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 659 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 644 Td (2. Set up environment \(copy only if the local file does not exist\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 629 Td (  Copy-Item environment.example.json environment.local.json) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 614 Td (  Edit baseUrl \(ending in /api\), tenantToken and ownerId.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 599 Td (  tenantToken: valid Tenant JWT, without the Bearer prefix.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 584 Td (  ownerId: test owner GUID. Use a dedicated test backend/account.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 569 Td (  A backend must be running/reachable; this does not use the xUnit container.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 554 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 539 Td (3. Run the full Newman security collection:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 524 Td (  New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force ../evidence) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 509 Td (  npm test) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 494 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 479 Td (Checks: API-11 unauthenticated request -> 401; valid Tenant profile;) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 464 Td (API-12 wrong-role property creation -> 403.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 449 Td (Report: tests/BackendAssessment/evidence/newman-results.json) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 434 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 419 Td (Postman option: import security.postman_collection.json and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 404 Td (environment.example.json; fill test values and run the collection.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 389 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 374 Td (Steps to follow for every suite:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 359 Td (1. Run initial tests; save console output and applicable TRX/JSON report.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 344 Td (2. Preserve initial evidence before another run overwrites it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 329 Td (3. If a test fails, reproduce the exact ID and record it in DEFECTS.md.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 314 Td (4. Separate application defects from test/configuration errors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 299 Td (5. Fix important defects; rerun the failing test and save retest evidence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 284 Td (6. Run the full suite for regression; record the actual outcome.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 269 Td (7. Close a defect only after a passing retest.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 254 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 239 Td (Defect registers:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 224 Td (  RentWise-Mobile/test/mobile_assessment/DEFECTS.md) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 209 Td (  tests/BackendAssessment/DEFECTS.md) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 194 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 179 Td (Never commit live-config.json, environment.local.json or secrets/tokens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 164 Td (All commands are PowerShell. A trailing backtick continues a command) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 42 149 Td (on the next line; do not put spaces after the backtick.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 42 28 Td (Page 3 of 3) Tj ET
